(5722886, 832587, 111599, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, but I think that if you had cropped the image so that we see only the crayons (in the same configuration), it would be much more powerful. I am not sure, but I think the focus is a tiny bit off as well?</td>', 'I like the subject, but I think that if you had cropped the image so that we see only the crayons (in the same configuration), it would be much more powerful. I am not sure, but I think the focus is a tiny bit off as well?', '2009-11-11 07:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
