(5722925, 832718, 110043, '<td valign="top">Like this one, great tones in the sky and the stark contrast of the house in the distance gives a nice focal point. Maybe the house could have been also centered vertically... and its a shame about the people on the right, but probably beyond control.</td>', 'Like this one, great tones in the sky and the stark contrast of the house in the distance gives a nice focal point. Maybe the house could have been also centered vertically... and its a shame about the people on the right, but probably beyond control.', '2009-11-11 08:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
