(5725168, 832047, 28564, '<td valign="top">wow... i like this kind of flowers... good shot, but i see too much the presence of the flash here... shadows are too hard for me, with a little panel (you can use everything to do this) or something to mask flash''s light would be better. (sorry for my english!)</td>', 'wow... i like this kind of flowers... good shot, but i see too much the presence of the flash here... shadows are too hard for me, with a little panel (you can use everything to do this) or something to mask flash''s light would be better. (sorry for my english!)', '2009-11-13 06:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
