(5725175, 832995, 28564, '<td valign="top">great shot, but simmetry is not so good for me... howewer i gave you a six...</td>', 'great shot, but simmetry is not so good for me... howewer i gave you a six...', '2009-11-13 06:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725191, 832472, 105457, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s difficult to nitpick at this photo, as it is so brilliantly done.<br/>I love the fact that the symmetry is not standard, and the gradients in the photo are ultra appealing, and very smooth.<br/>Could be better if there was no glow, it gives it a dreamy look, but you scored a 10 from me.<br/>Great work!</td>', 'Well, it''s difficult to nitpick at this photo, as it is so brilliantly done.I love the fact that the symmetry is not standard, and the gradients in the photo are ultra appealing, and very smooth.Could be better if there was no glow, it gives it a dreamy look, but you scored a 10 from me.Great work!', '2009-11-13 06:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725194, 832974, 105457, '<td valign="top">Ah, I almost gave you a 6 because I thought it was a standard reflection, and while reflections are symmetrical, I tended not to rate the as high as the non-reflective ones.<br/>I had to look three times to discover that the reflection below is not from the immediate above tomato. It''s from the opposite one!<br/>9 because I''m not being able to discover how you did it :)</td>', 'Ah, I almost gave you a 6 because I thought it was a standard reflection, and while reflections are symmetrical, I tended not to rate the as high as the non-reflective ones.I had to look three times to discover that the reflection below is not from the immediate above tomato. It''s from the opposite one!9 because I''m not being able to discover how you did it :)', '2009-11-13 06:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725195, 832942, 105457, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, a good picture that would be perfect but it is crooked. Straightening should improve this shot a lot.</td>', 'Unfortunately, a good picture that would be perfect but it is crooked. Straightening should improve this shot a lot.', '2009-11-13 06:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725196, 831773, 105457, '<td valign="top">Sorry, it''s a bit crooked (more noticeable in the top two crosses).</td>', 'Sorry, it''s a bit crooked (more noticeable in the top two crosses).', '2009-11-13 06:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725200, 832786, 105457, '<td valign="top">Ultra wide angle :)<br/>Very symmetric, a 7 from me.</td>', 'Ultra wide angle :)Very symmetric, a 7 from me.', '2009-11-13 06:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725201, 832891, 105457, '<td valign="top">Sorry I can''t find the symmetry here. Should do well on another challenge, albeit I would like to see it from a lower perspective.</td>', 'Sorry I can''t find the symmetry here. Should do well on another challenge, albeit I would like to see it from a lower perspective.', '2009-11-13 06:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725203, 832957, 105457, '<td valign="top">Very difficult shot to pull, the dynamic range is too big, the sky is burned, and the foreground is a bit dark. Would be great to do it HDR, but difficult for basic editing.</td>', 'Very difficult shot to pull, the dynamic range is too big, the sky is burned, and the foreground is a bit dark. Would be great to do it HDR, but difficult for basic editing.', '2009-11-13 06:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725204, 831796, 105457, '<td valign="top">Love the colours, great architecture shot here, and great leading lines. A 9 from me.</td>', 'Love the colours, great architecture shot here, and great leading lines. A 9 from me.', '2009-11-13 07:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725205, 832848, 105457, '<td valign="top">Brilliant symmetry, in my opinion just handicapped by the underexposure of the iron, should have more contrast. 7</td>', 'Brilliant symmetry, in my opinion just handicapped by the underexposure of the iron, should have more contrast. 7', '2009-11-13 07:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725207, 832820, 105457, '<td valign="top">Because I tend to like pencil photography a lot for myself, I can relate to how difficult it is to get al pencils the exact same length in the tip.<br/>Brilliantly well done and a 9 from me!</td>', 'Because I tend to like pencil photography a lot for myself, I can relate to how difficult it is to get al pencils the exact same length in the tip.Brilliantly well done and a 9 from me!', '2009-11-13 07:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725209, 832680, 105457, '<td valign="top">I like the leading lines very much, and it actually looks as it will take off, but as an alien ship :)<br/>Very symmetrical all around, and brilliant tones, love the reflections.</td>', 'I like the leading lines very much, and it actually looks as it will take off, but as an alien ship :)Very symmetrical all around, and brilliant tones, love the reflections.', '2009-11-13 07:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725211, 832720, 105457, '<td valign="top">Good symmetry, but could used a bit more PP. Contrast and saturation would improve this photo a lot.</td>', 'Good symmetry, but could used a bit more PP. Contrast and saturation would improve this photo a lot.', '2009-11-13 07:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725213, 832723, 105457, '<td valign="top">OK, I give up :) <br/>It''s actually a perfect symmetry. I liked very much that the numbers are mirrored but the colours are opposite. The only distracting thing is the reflex on the bells and side, but other than that, a great entry.<br/>Great effort! <br/>10</td>', 'OK, I give up :) It''s actually a perfect symmetry. I liked very much that the numbers are mirrored but the colours are opposite. The only distracting thing is the reflex on the bells and side, but other than that, a great entry.Great effort! 10', '2009-11-13 07:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725486, 832680, 108580, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the X-Wing launch bay of a Star Wars Battleship.<br/>Nice everything, tones, sharpness, lighting, exposure etc.<br/>The lack of carbon based lifeforms is unearthly. WD</td>', 'Reminds me of the X-Wing launch bay of a Star Wars Battleship.Nice everything, tones, sharpness, lighting, exposure etc.The lack of carbon based lifeforms is unearthly. WD', '2009-11-13 13:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725491, 832343, 99981, '<td valign="top">Classy shot! I''m not a fan of the border, maybe because of its black sides, i think the top and the bottom would be enough! The light is great! You did a nice job there!</td>', 'Classy shot! I''m not a fan of the border, maybe because of its black sides, i think the top and the bottom would be enough! The light is great! You did a nice job there!', '2009-11-13 13:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725493, 832330, 99981, '<td valign="top">Strong image! Great choice for the B&amp;W! The black part at the bottom could be croped in my opinion. Nice shot.</td>', 'Strong image! Great choice for the B&W! The black part at the bottom could be croped in my opinion. Nice shot.', '2009-11-13 13:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725496, 832697, 99981, '<td valign="top">Did you count them? There are almost 17 each side! Nature is great, isn''t it? Your shot is simple but really pleasing! I like the centered composition, the colors and border. You should try different angles next time, i think you would get good results too! Good luck.</td>', 'Did you count them? There are almost 17 each side! Nature is great, isn''t it? Your shot is simple but really pleasing! I like the centered composition, the colors and border. You should try different angles next time, i think you would get good results too! Good luck.', '2009-11-13 13:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725497, 832748, 99981, '<td valign="top">Interesting textures and great light. I think you could rotate the image a little to the left, but it''s really nice anyway!</td>', 'Interesting textures and great light. I think you could rotate the image a little to the left, but it''s really nice anyway!', '2009-11-13 13:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725501, 832150, 25522, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this shot.  I''m not sure it fits the challenge.</td>', 'I really enjoy this shot.  I''m not sure it fits the challenge.', '2009-11-13 13:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725515, 832778, 99981, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of the composition of this but i think your choice were nice and the light is nice! Good luck!</td>', 'I''m not a fan of the composition of this but i think your choice were nice and the light is nice! Good luck!', '2009-11-13 13:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725518, 832980, 99981, '<td valign="top">The colors are not very interesting and their expressions make the shot look a snapshot. I like the idea though. The other guy should have a banana too. :D <br/>Good luck!</td>', 'The colors are not very interesting and their expressions make the shot look a snapshot. I like the idea though. The other guy should have a banana too. :D Good luck!', '2009-11-13 13:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
