(5725522, 832681, 99981, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of the background and those parts at the left corners are distracting! There are some noise at this image and it''s giving it a nice old look though. I think you did a nice job changing it to B&amp;W too. Good luck at this challenge.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of the background and those parts at the left corners are distracting! There are some noise at this image and it''s giving it a nice old look though. I think you did a nice job changing it to B&W too. Good luck at this challenge.', '2009-11-13 13:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725523, 832897, 99981, '<td valign="top">The image seems to be really OOF and the light doesn''t help it too, so as the colors. I think i like the reflection and textures, next time you should give more emphasys for these two things. I don''t think the image meets the challenge too. Sorry if i was rude. Good luck.</td>', 'The image seems to be really OOF and the light doesn''t help it too, so as the colors. I think i like the reflection and textures, next time you should give more emphasys for these two things. I don''t think the image meets the challenge too. Sorry if i was rude. Good luck.', '2009-11-13 13:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725524, 832668, 99981, '<td valign="top">Good choice of object but i think you should try more exposure next time, the image is very dark and i almost can''t see the boat! Good luck, sorry if i was rude.</td>', 'Good choice of object but i think you should try more exposure next time, the image is very dark and i almost can''t see the boat! Good luck, sorry if i was rude.', '2009-11-13 13:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725527, 832944, 99981, '<td valign="top">Not much symmetry for me. The colors are nice though.</td>', 'Not much symmetry for me. The colors are nice though.', '2009-11-13 13:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725529, 832955, 99981, '<td valign="top">This is great! What is it!?</td>', 'This is great! What is it!?', '2009-11-13 13:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725530, 832973, 99981, '<td valign="top">Great work! The colors, the composition and the light are stunning! It''s really good to look at this shot! One of my favorites so far!</td>', 'Great work! The colors, the composition and the light are stunning! It''s really good to look at this shot! One of my favorites so far!', '2009-11-13 13:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5725532, 832984, 99981, '<td valign="top">Great colors and textures! Did you add some topaz to it? The composition is very strong! I really like this shot.</td>', 'Great colors and textures! Did you add some topaz to it? The composition is very strong! I really like this shot.', '2009-11-13 13:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
