(5729579, 832080, 106233, '<td valign="top">I must tell that i am not scoring well the pictures based on the reflection symmetry, because IMHO obtain a symmetry on a reflection is something simple, where everything is just ready to shoot.<br/>BUT, i must also say that this picture just popped way over all the other of its class. The lighting is great, and the symmetry on the light rays just met perfectly the challenge. Congrats. This one will score well.</td>', 'I must tell that i am not scoring well the pictures based on the reflection symmetry, because IMHO obtain a symmetry on a reflection is something simple, where everything is just ready to shoot.BUT, i must also say that this picture just popped way over all the other of its class. The lighting is great, and the symmetry on the light rays just met perfectly the challenge. Congrats. This one will score well.', '2009-11-16 18:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729581, 832848, 106233, '<td valign="top">Simple, clever and beatiful. Great light!</td>', 'Simple, clever and beatiful. Great light!', '2009-11-16 18:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729585, 832994, 106233, '<td valign="top">Great colors and light! And a great effort to achieve symmetry, but you needed one step to the right and a little framing to the left. Then it would be perfect. Anyway. Congrats! Great picture at all.</td>', 'Great colors and light! And a great effort to achieve symmetry, but you needed one step to the right and a little framing to the left. Then it would be perfect. Anyway. Congrats! Great picture at all.', '2009-11-16 18:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729587, 832684, 106233, '<td valign="top">The composition is GREAT, and definitely met the challenge! but the light is poor, and the picture seem a little soft.</td>', 'The composition is GREAT, and definitely met the challenge! but the light is poor, and the picture seem a little soft.', '2009-11-16 18:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729589, 832350, 106233, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but you left something on the bottom right without its correspondent on the left.</td>', 'Good composition, but you left something on the bottom right without its correspondent on the left.', '2009-11-16 18:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729594, 832641, 106233, '<td valign="top">Your picture is very beautiful and the light is great, but symmetry based on reflections is a lazy composition, because the symmetric part is ready for you. Will give you a 6, wich is a boost on the score I am giving to the pictures based on reflections.</td>', 'Your picture is very beautiful and the light is great, but symmetry based on reflections is a lazy composition, because the symmetric part is ready for you. Will give you a 6, wich is a boost on the score I am giving to the pictures based on reflections.', '2009-11-16 18:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729596, 832942, 106233, '<td valign="top">Almost perfect. I think you could have tilted it a little on PS to adjust it to a ribbon winner!</td>', 'Almost perfect. I think you could have tilted it a little on PS to adjust it to a ribbon winner!', '2009-11-16 18:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729609, 831690, 106233, '<td valign="top">OK. I will buy it! I am not giving good scores to compositions based on reflections, because this would be a lazy way to achieve symmetry. But I think you were very creative, and got a really interesting composition. Also, the blue sky on the water is a very interesting achievement, considering the washed out real sky.</td>', 'OK. I will buy it! I am not giving good scores to compositions based on reflections, because this would be a lazy way to achieve symmetry. But I think you were very creative, and got a really interesting composition. Also, the blue sky on the water is a very interesting achievement, considering the washed out real sky.', '2009-11-16 18:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729612, 832774, 106233, '<td valign="top">Great light!!! The colors are beautiful! I want to eat a kiwi!!<br/>(lacking of symmetry, however)</td>', 'Great light!!! The colors are beautiful! I want to eat a kiwi!!(lacking of symmetry, however)', '2009-11-16 18:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729617, 832427, 91089, '<td valign="top">This photo is simply amazing. I love how the marbles are perfectly balanced on the forks... and the amazing attention to detail to add that bug-- or whatever it is-- to the top. 10</td>', 'This photo is simply amazing. I love how the marbles are perfectly balanced on the forks... and the amazing attention to detail to add that bug-- or whatever it is-- to the top. 10', '2009-11-16 19:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729631, 832993, 106233, '<td valign="top">This is the best of the three pictures of this place. Great symmetry, great colors! Very well done!</td>', 'This is the best of the three pictures of this place. Great symmetry, great colors! Very well done!', '2009-11-16 19:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729676, 832919, 47470, '<td valign="top">Since there isn''t a huge range of tones and the pattern isn''t terribly interesting, it would be nice to have something in there to break up the flatness of the subject.  I don''t mean to sound harsh, but I think this could work better with some extra visual stimulation.</td>', 'Since there isn''t a huge range of tones and the pattern isn''t terribly interesting, it would be nice to have something in there to break up the flatness of the subject.  I don''t mean to sound harsh, but I think this could work better with some extra visual stimulation.', '2009-11-16 20:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729684, 832701, 110186, '<td valign="top">This is well done. You''ve caught a pretty clear reflection, which is difficult to do.</td>', 'This is well done. You''ve caught a pretty clear reflection, which is difficult to do.', '2009-11-16 20:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729688, 831765, 47470, '<td valign="top">This same picture of this bridge has been taken thousands of times.  I wish you had done something to make it stand out from all the others--throw some balloons in there, wait for a bird to fly through, wait for some dramatic lighting (it''s winter, so the sun stays pretty low, which makes for great light on here at most times during the day), anything!  I don''t mean to sound so harsh, but I wish you had let your creativity come through more.</td>', 'This same picture of this bridge has been taken thousands of times.  I wish you had done something to make it stand out from all the others--throw some balloons in there, wait for a bird to fly through, wait for some dramatic lighting (it''s winter, so the sun stays pretty low, which makes for great light on here at most times during the day), anything!  I don''t mean to sound so harsh, but I wish you had let your creativity come through more.', '2009-11-16 20:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729690, 832669, 47470, '<td valign="top">Great use of shallow depth of field.  I love how the background blurs into tones.</td>', 'Great use of shallow depth of field.  I love how the background blurs into tones.', '2009-11-16 20:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729691, 832820, 47470, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this is due to the reflective nature of the pencils, but this looks over-sharpened and therefore very harsh.</td>', 'I don''t know if this is due to the reflective nature of the pencils, but this looks over-sharpened and therefore very harsh.', '2009-11-16 20:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729692, 832964, 47470, '<td valign="top">I''m curious as to why you lit the face from underneath.  "Monster lighting" (as it''s called when you do that) is not very flattering on anyone.</td>', 'I''m curious as to why you lit the face from underneath.  "Monster lighting" (as it''s called when you do that) is not very flattering on anyone.', '2009-11-16 20:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729695, 832942, 47470, '<td valign="top">This image has so much potential.  The colors are great and the reflections are cool, but I''m looking for a little bit of flare (not the kind caused when light hits the front of the lens, but the kind that shows when the photographer adds a touch of their trademark personal creativity).  I wish there was something that made this stand out.  Let those creative juices flow!  Experiment!</td>', 'This image has so much potential.  The colors are great and the reflections are cool, but I''m looking for a little bit of flare (not the kind caused when light hits the front of the lens, but the kind that shows when the photographer adds a touch of their trademark personal creativity).  I wish there was something that made this stand out.  Let those creative juices flow!  Experiment!', '2009-11-16 20:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729696, 832073, 47470, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites from this challenge.  The geometry and texture are gorgeous.</td>', 'One of my favorites from this challenge.  The geometry and texture are gorgeous.', '2009-11-16 20:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729698, 831798, 47470, '<td valign="top">The light on the boy  is ok, but the light on the baby is "monster" lighting (lit from underneath), which isn''t flattering on anyone, no matter how adorable their smile is!  Since you have one person rightside up and one upside down, try lighting them directly from the side so no one is lit from underneath.</td>', 'The light on the boy  is ok, but the light on the baby is "monster" lighting (lit from underneath), which isn''t flattering on anyone, no matter how adorable their smile is!  Since you have one person rightside up and one upside down, try lighting them directly from the side so no one is lit from underneath.', '2009-11-16 20:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729703, 832953, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish this had a different title.  I was a little disappointed when I found out these cool statues are actually mundane bookends.  But I do like that you paired colorful texture with the solid-toned simplicity of the subject.  Maybe leave a little more room at the bottom so their feet aren''t cut off?</td>', 'I wish this had a different title.  I was a little disappointed when I found out these cool statues are actually mundane bookends.  But I do like that you paired colorful texture with the solid-toned simplicity of the subject.  Maybe leave a little more room at the bottom so their feet aren''t cut off?', '2009-11-16 20:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729705, 832878, 47470, '<td valign="top">I don''t this the long frame does anything for this image.  Don''t underestimate the beauty of negative space!  I also wish there was a gorgeous highlight on the inside of the tomatoes to make them look deliciously juicy.</td>', 'I don''t this the long frame does anything for this image.  Don''t underestimate the beauty of negative space!  I also wish there was a gorgeous highlight on the inside of the tomatoes to make them look deliciously juicy.', '2009-11-16 20:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729706, 832876, 47470, '<td valign="top">The overall tonality of this image is slightly flat.  There are lots of middle grays and a few blacks, but hardly any whites (the lighter parts are actually still grays--check the numerical values in photoshop).  Some directional lighting (maybe from the side and/or slightly behind?) would add some beautiful highlights.</td>', 'The overall tonality of this image is slightly flat.  There are lots of middle grays and a few blacks, but hardly any whites (the lighter parts are actually still grays--check the numerical values in photoshop).  Some directional lighting (maybe from the side and/or slightly behind?) would add some beautiful highlights.', '2009-11-16 20:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729803, 832827, 112004, '<td valign="top">Good DOF</td>', 'Good DOF', '2009-11-16 21:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729804, 832641, 112004, '<td valign="top">out standing lighting. nice shadows good reflection.</td>', 'out standing lighting. nice shadows good reflection.', '2009-11-16 21:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729806, 832047, 112004, '<td valign="top">Great Macro. nice contrast and color.</td>', 'Great Macro. nice contrast and color.', '2009-11-16 22:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729818, 832876, 111808, '<td valign="top">Strangely beautiful are ordinary Things...</td>', 'Strangely beautiful are ordinary Things...', '2009-11-16 22:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729821, 832975, 111808, '<td valign="top">It''s symmetrical - and it''s scary! Great capture of a definitely creepy crawly, even the shadows are a match.</td>', 'It''s symmetrical - and it''s scary! Great capture of a definitely creepy crawly, even the shadows are a match.', '2009-11-16 22:14:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5729823, 832771, 111808, '<td valign="top">The reflection in the still water is very nice, and the lighting utilising a tinge of pink blends in quite well with the shaded blues.</td>', 'The reflection in the still water is very nice, and the lighting utilising a tinge of pink blends in quite well with the shaded blues.', '2009-11-16 22:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729826, 832992, 111808, '<td valign="top">It took me a moment to be able to see past the unexpected central patterns in this &amp; it was well worth the study. Superb symmetry.</td>', 'It took me a moment to be able to see past the unexpected central patterns in this & it was well worth the study. Superb symmetry.', '2009-11-16 22:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729839, 832494, 111808, '<td valign="top">This is my absolute favourite in this challenge - the curvatures, the repeating patterns comprising the trestle, the colour contrasts in the missing pieces on the top which tell you it definitely is no longer used, the parallel green trees up on the top left. I even like the white sky because it is echoed in the rushing water at the bottom, and the wild tangles of Autumn foliage frame it perfectly. Superb contrasts &amp; colour blends.</td>', 'This is my absolute favourite in this challenge - the curvatures, the repeating patterns comprising the trestle, the colour contrasts in the missing pieces on the top which tell you it definitely is no longer used, the parallel green trees up on the top left. I even like the white sky because it is echoed in the rushing water at the bottom, and the wild tangles of Autumn foliage frame it perfectly. Superb contrasts & colour blends.', '2009-11-16 22:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729846, 832684, 83313, '<td valign="top">Comes off a bit flat looking, I''m afraid. Perhaps a touch of some adjustments such as levels and curves could help give it a little more pop. Perhaps the key to an electrical tower shot may be the need to have an interesting sky backing it up.</td>', 'Comes off a bit flat looking, I''m afraid. Perhaps a touch of some adjustments such as levels and curves could help give it a little more pop. Perhaps the key to an electrical tower shot may be the need to have an interesting sky backing it up.', '2009-11-16 22:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729851, 832472, 83313, '<td valign="top">Are these official DPC "competition grade" wine glasses? Mm-Hmmm, I thought not. You need to be mindful of that in the future. <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//webpages.charter.net/yospiff/Images/Smileys/cop.gif'', strrpos(''//webpages.charter.net/yospiff/Images/Smileys/cop.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//webpages.charter.net/yospiff/Images/Smileys/cop.gif"/> <br/>The cliche police are watching.</td>', 'Are these official DPC "competition grade" wine glasses? Mm-Hmmm, I thought not. You need to be mindful of that in the future.  The cliche police are watching.', '2009-11-16 23:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729852, 831780, 83313, '<td valign="top">AHHHHHH!!! Run! It''s Mothra!!!!!</td>', 'AHHHHHH!!! Run! It''s Mothra!!!!!', '2009-11-16 23:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729854, 832442, 83313, '<td valign="top">So you are suggesting here that your photography is better after a few rounds? Yes, I think that is what you are saying. (No vote, snarky comment only.)</td>', 'So you are suggesting here that your photography is better after a few rounds? Yes, I think that is what you are saying. (No vote, snarky comment only.)', '2009-11-16 23:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729855, 831796, 83313, '<td valign="top">Took me a good long look to realize this was simply the underside of a pair of bridges. Great catch of the light. I''ve not been able to get such a shot to appear anything but boring.</td>', 'Took me a good long look to realize this was simply the underside of a pair of bridges. Great catch of the light. I''ve not been able to get such a shot to appear anything but boring.', '2009-11-16 23:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729872, 832589, 111474, '<td valign="top">Focus is to soft on the eyes (Where I expect it to be). Plus it does not realy meet the challange - A closer crop would have made the symmetry more prominent.</td>', 'Focus is to soft on the eyes (Where I expect it to be). Plus it does not realy meet the challange - A closer crop would have made the symmetry more prominent.', '2009-11-16 23:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729879, 832957, 111474, '<td valign="top">Very cool composition. Pitty the sky is blown out - An off camera flash "may" have been enough to ballence the exposure. Unfortunaly this realy spoils it for me.</td>', 'Very cool composition. Pitty the sky is blown out - An off camera flash "may" have been enough to ballence the exposure. Unfortunaly this realy spoils it for me.', '2009-11-16 23:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729882, 832774, 111474, '<td valign="top">LOL - there isn''t one (quite). But Very cool all the same - 7</td>', 'LOL - there isn''t one (quite). But Very cool all the same - 7', '2009-11-16 23:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729889, 831494, 111474, '<td valign="top">There are elements of Symmetry in the subject - but not in the why that you took the photo.</td>', 'There are elements of Symmetry in the subject - but not in the why that you took the photo.', '2009-11-16 23:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729949, 832047, 110186, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite for the challenge. I love the details and I think it was very well done.</td>', 'This is my favorite for the challenge. I love the details and I think it was very well done.', '2009-11-17 02:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730061, 832949, 49109, '<td valign="top">sky is blown a bit too much for my taste, but brillant idea nonetheless. bumping up</td>', 'sky is blown a bit too much for my taste, but brillant idea nonetheless. bumping up', '2009-11-17 05:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730065, 832989, 111474, '<td valign="top">Love the exposure for the biuldings, but you need a graduated NDF to stop the sky blowing out at the same time.</td>', 'Love the exposure for the biuldings, but you need a graduated NDF to stop the sky blowing out at the same time.', '2009-11-17 05:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730066, 832684, 111474, '<td valign="top">This looks like it has a very shallow DoF, so most of it is fuzzy. If you increase your f Stop and focus 1/3 to 2/3s of the way up the pylon you will have more of it sharp.</td>', 'This looks like it has a very shallow DoF, so most of it is fuzzy. If you increase your f Stop and focus 1/3 to 2/3s of the way up the pylon you will have more of it sharp.', '2009-11-17 05:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730067, 832980, 111474, '<td valign="top">Very clever take on the subject</td>', 'Very clever take on the subject', '2009-11-17 05:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730080, 832486, 73942, '<td valign="top">I like the title you''ve chosen and nice to see something original in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the title you''ve chosen and nice to see something original in the challenge.', '2009-11-17 06:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730120, 832790, 99981, '<td valign="top">Great capture! I love how it''s just the towers and the white background(sky). Fits the challenge perfectly. 10</td>', 'Great capture! I love how it''s just the towers and the white background(sky). Fits the challenge perfectly. 10', '2009-11-17 08:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730205, 832301, 36981, '<td valign="top">Wow - what an amazing entry.  This is clever &amp; creative!</td>', 'Wow - what an amazing entry.  This is clever & creative!', '2009-11-17 09:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730209, 832845, 36981, '<td valign="top">Fascinating - is this taken through a window?  The subtle colors are beautiful, and I love the way the book is warped.</td>', 'Fascinating - is this taken through a window?  The subtle colors are beautiful, and I love the way the book is warped.', '2009-11-17 09:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730216, 831796, 36981, '<td valign="top">This has a very art deco feel to it.  I love the clean lines &amp; the light in this - one of my favorites in this challenge!</td>', 'This has a very art deco feel to it.  I love the clean lines & the light in this - one of my favorites in this challenge!', '2009-11-17 09:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730218, 832992, 36981, '<td valign="top">I have zero idea what I''m looking at, but I enjoy the symmetry and the tones in this one.</td>', 'I have zero idea what I''m looking at, but I enjoy the symmetry and the tones in this one.', '2009-11-17 09:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730219, 832100, 36981, '<td valign="top">I love this image; what a great perspective.</td>', 'I love this image; what a great perspective.', '2009-11-17 09:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730266, 832692, 57447, '<td valign="top">I''ve always liked corn shots, this is good but a bit small.</td>', 'I''ve always liked corn shots, this is good but a bit small.', '2009-11-17 10:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730307, 832389, 99981, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. You did a good job centering this "triangle" part. I wish i could see this in B&amp;W or even Sepia. Great blues!</td>', 'I like the composition. You did a good job centering this "triangle" part. I wish i could see this in B&W or even Sepia. Great blues!', '2009-11-17 11:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730313, 832856, 107027, '<td valign="top">This one is my favorite!  I love the symmetry here and it is just so clean and simple...Good luck!</td>', 'This one is my favorite!  I love the symmetry here and it is just so clean and simple...Good luck!', '2009-11-17 11:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730315, 832982, 107027, '<td valign="top">What you chose to photograph is obviously very symmetrical but the photo is nice and sharp, I love the colors and I also really like the puddle in the foreground reflecting the dock above, great shot!</td>', 'What you chose to photograph is obviously very symmetrical but the photo is nice and sharp, I love the colors and I also really like the puddle in the foreground reflecting the dock above, great shot!', '2009-11-17 11:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730320, 832828, 107027, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, the reflections show symmetry and I like the fact that the reflections are not crystal clear.  Your headline is great too, there is a story going on here and that means you captured a great moment, good luck!</td>', 'Awesome shot, the reflections show symmetry and I like the fact that the reflections are not crystal clear.  Your headline is great too, there is a story going on here and that means you captured a great moment, good luck!', '2009-11-17 11:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730322, 832949, 107027, '<td valign="top">Great concept, great execution!</td>', 'Great concept, great execution!', '2009-11-17 11:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730324, 832893, 107027, '<td valign="top">The sky is beautiful in this shot and you composed the picture very well, nice shot!</td>', 'The sky is beautiful in this shot and you composed the picture very well, nice shot!', '2009-11-17 11:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730328, 832379, 107027, '<td valign="top">I really like the angle you chose for this picture.  When you have a subject with such natural symmetry it shows that you don''t need to line the subject up right in the middle, clearly showing symmetry from left to right (as I did).  Good luck!</td>', 'I really like the angle you chose for this picture.  When you have a subject with such natural symmetry it shows that you don''t need to line the subject up right in the middle, clearly showing symmetry from left to right (as I did).  Good luck!', '2009-11-17 11:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730330, 832682, 107027, '<td valign="top">Great shot, very creative and I really like the lighting!</td>', 'Great shot, very creative and I really like the lighting!', '2009-11-17 11:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730335, 832717, 107027, '<td valign="top">Wow, such still water...that reflection is crystal clear and sharp.  Great shot!</td>', 'Wow, such still water...that reflection is crystal clear and sharp.  Great shot!', '2009-11-17 11:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730336, 832080, 107027, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, I like the beams of light!</td>', 'Very nice photo, I like the beams of light!', '2009-11-17 11:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730338, 832427, 107027, '<td valign="top">Very creative and I love the lighting, the red background and the fact that everything is so sharp.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very creative and I love the lighting, the red background and the fact that everything is so sharp.  Good luck!', '2009-11-17 11:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730339, 832975, 107027, '<td valign="top">Symmetry in nature...Well shot!</td>', 'Symmetry in nature...Well shot!', '2009-11-17 11:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730342, 832105, 107027, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  It looks great in black and white and has such an old, classic look to it.  Well composed and great capture of symmetry!</td>', 'I really like this shot.  It looks great in black and white and has such an old, classic look to it.  Well composed and great capture of symmetry!', '2009-11-17 11:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730345, 832782, 107027, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Everything is symmetrical and sharp.  I also like the tight crop.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice.  Everything is symmetrical and sharp.  I also like the tight crop.  Good luck!', '2009-11-17 11:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730347, 832923, 107027, '<td valign="top">Again, another creative, yet simple show of symmetry.  Cool lighting, I''d be interested to know how you set everything up...good luck!</td>', 'Again, another creative, yet simple show of symmetry.  Cool lighting, I''d be interested to know how you set everything up...good luck!', '2009-11-17 11:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730348, 832774, 107027, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting and the color of the kiwi, good luck!</td>', 'I love the lighting and the color of the kiwi, good luck!', '2009-11-17 11:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730349, 832330, 107027, '<td valign="top">Great composition and I like the black and white!</td>', 'Great composition and I like the black and white!', '2009-11-17 11:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730351, 832073, 107027, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the clouds as well!</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the clouds as well!', '2009-11-17 11:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730352, 832984, 107027, '<td valign="top">I like the crop, the colors and the fact that you can really see the texture of this ship.  Good luck!</td>', 'I like the crop, the colors and the fact that you can really see the texture of this ship.  Good luck!', '2009-11-17 11:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
