(5731112, 831756, 83650, '<td valign="top">Good symmetry, but the shadowing of the sticks on the bars jump right out.  Two or three light sources may have given a softer look than a single light source.</td>', 'Good symmetry, but the shadowing of the sticks on the bars jump right out.  Two or three light sources may have given a softer look than a single light source.', '2009-11-17 22:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
