(5731536, 831796, 30982, '<td valign="top">You produce top ten work week after week after week - VERY impressive!!  But even better - this is at a Starbucks??  Way cool!  A blue ribbon shot AND your daily coffee - can''t beat that!  Congrats!</td>', 'You produce top ten work week after week after week - VERY impressive!!  But even better - this is at a Starbucks??  Way cool!  A blue ribbon shot AND your daily coffee - can''t beat that!  Congrats!', '2009-11-18 01:15:56.000000', NULL, 0),
