(5738840, 831712, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from a member of the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>You asked that your photograph be critiqued by a member of the Critique Club in this challenge. <br/> <br/>This is an excellent shot.  It scored very well.  You thought about what you where going to do and you succeeded.<br/> <br/>I think what may have helped you here would have been to have a wider shot.  Your shot is very thin.  Other than that your focus is spot on, you are sharp, your colours are excellent. <br/> <br/>Well done on this shot and the score,</td>', 'Hi from a member of the Critique Club! You asked that your photograph be critiqued by a member of the Critique Club in this challenge.  This is an excellent shot.  It scored very well.  You thought about what you where going to do and you succeeded. I think what may have helped you here would have been to have a wider shot.  Your shot is very thin.  Other than that your focus is spot on, you are sharp, your colours are excellent.  Well done on this shot and the score,', '2009-11-23 21:18:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5738850, 832463, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from a member of the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>You asked that your photograph be critiqued by a member of the Critique Club in this challenge. <br/> <br/>Well WOW, you got no comments on this shot!!! Well, let me be the first to comment, <br/> <br/>This is a fair shot, a hard shot to get.  I think that what happened here is that you have just a head popping out of no where, it almost looks like it is stuffed to be honest.  I think that if you had this in a portrait mode, it may have scored a little better. <br/> <br/>Your sharpness is spot on, your colours are good.  You have a nice blurred background going on which compliments the great sharpness you have going on with your subject. <br/> <br/>Keep on shooting<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hi from a member of the Critique Club! You asked that your photograph be critiqued by a member of the Critique Club in this challenge.  Well WOW, you got no comments on this shot!!! Well, let me be the first to comment,  This is a fair shot, a hard shot to get.  I think that what happened here is that you have just a head popping out of no where, it almost looks like it is stuffed to be honest.  I think that if you had this in a portrait mode, it may have scored a little better.  Your sharpness is spot on, your colours are good.  You have a nice blurred background going on which compliments the great sharpness you have going on with your subject.  Keep on shooting ', '2009-11-23 21:22:52.000000', NULL, 0),
