(5749276, 832993, 99981, '<td valign="top">Hi...i saw this shot when i was at your profile and i can see there is just one comment about it.<br/>Well...i think it''s a nice shot and you had a good idea. Just think that you could have tried different perspectives because the sun light on the right is a little distracting at this one. The problem you mentioned about it''s not being centered could be fixed with Image - Image rotation - arbitrary. You would probabbly get a better score. I wish i could see more saturation on the sky too. Sorry if i was rude. Hope i could be helpfull.</td>', 'Hi...i saw this shot when i was at your profile and i can see there is just one comment about it.Well...i think it''s a nice shot and you had a good idea. Just think that you could have tried different perspectives because the sun light on the right is a little distracting at this one. The problem you mentioned about it''s not being centered could be fixed with Image - Image rotation - arbitrary. You would probabbly get a better score. I wish i could see more saturation on the sky too. Sorry if i was rude. Hope i could be helpfull.', '2009-12-01 22:12:57.000000', NULL, 0),
