(5813346, 832838, 28427, '<td valign="top">What? this photograph passed the voting round without any comment? Well, then I''ll be the first to do so: beautiful photograph showing nice details of the moon.  I gave it an 8 and i.m.h.o. your entry should have ended up higher than this.<br/>Good job.</td>', 'What? this photograph passed the voting round without any comment? Well, then I''ll be the first to do so: beautiful photograph showing nice details of the moon.  I gave it an 8 and i.m.h.o. your entry should have ended up higher than this.Good job.', '2010-01-15 17:37:06.000000', NULL, 0),
