(6331041, 832464, 66384, '<td valign="top">I''m going to spoil your "no comments". :)<br/> <br/>I think the symmetry is perfect here. I like color, and the light and shadows on the doors. I cannot imagine why anyone would score this below 4. The old stones and mortar are lovely. I can see that some people might not find the WOW factor they are looking for, but no way is it "bad". I wonder if it would have more impact in high contrast B/W.</td>', 'I''m going to spoil your "no comments". :) I think the symmetry is perfect here. I like color, and the light and shadows on the doors. I cannot imagine why anyone would score this below 4. The old stones and mortar are lovely. I can see that some people might not find the WOW factor they are looking for, but no way is it "bad". I wonder if it would have more impact in high contrast B/W.', '2011-02-24 14:18:26.000000', NULL, 0),
